  "description": "I got caught having a one-sided crush on my childhood friend of 20 years.\n\n\"I never took you for this kind of person, Yang Yu-in. You're seriously so creepy. You're such a total pervert.\"\n\nCreepy, gross, total pervert.   \nIf I had known my pure affection would be trampled on like this...\n\n'Thinking about it, this is so unfair!'\n\nWho was the one giving me mixed signals in the first place? Is this my fault?   \nI'm going to show you what a real pervert is today.\n\n\"Lee Baek, wanna make a bet? If you cum in my hand within 5 minutes, you lose.\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \nR19: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4343003808)   \nR15: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4343003809)",
